  "architecture_family": "mobilenet_v3_small",
  "description": "A memory-efficient MobileNetV3 backbone with safe training practices and reliable inference for long-tail bird species classification.",
  "reasoning": "MobileNetV3 is known for its efficiency and good performance on spectrogram data. The 'safe' variant avoids risky custom ops and uses conservative regularization (dropout) to ensure stability on Kaggle. It's well-suited for the 90-minute CPU runtime constraint and handles the long-tail distribution better than overly complex models. The architecture is also DP-safe with simpler head design, reducing risk of CUDA/DataParallel issues."
}

